      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Maru-marker opening Koga Domain's fascicle-9 entry. Circle y1353-1430, 古 y1458-1536, 河 y1641-1715, 藩 y1810-1893. This is the only maru-marker on the leaf. A full-paper ink sweep (columns with 3 or more dark pixels, threshold 140, over x60-2600 and y260-4200) returns sixteen column groups, and the only two right of the marker are the running header at x2218-2279 and the printed page number at x2193-2241, both page furniture. No previous domain's material overflows onto this leaf, so everything else here is Koga's."
      },
