        "value": "兵隊"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Troops — the military section heading that closes a domain's fascicle-9 entry, set in its own column and starting about 150 px lower than the office headings to its right. It prints alone here: a full-height row-block scan of x491-555 returns only 兵 y1163-1225 and 隊 y1249-1310 plus one 6-px speck at y3514, and no ink at all stands left of x490 on the paper. Koga's troop figures print on the facing leaf: lower_p218_left, opened and read at 1.6x, carries two columns to the RIGHT of its ○小諸藩 marker — 拾二小隊　五百七拾六人（一小隊役員トモ五拾六人）and 礮隊四組　二拾八人一組役員トモ九人 — which by the right-to-left rule belong to the previous domain, Koga."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "古河藩兵隊見出"
