        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Senior councillor Doi. Five glyphs at 2.2x — 土 井 大 參 事 — with tops at y2017, 2146, 2274, 2398 and 2523, a pitch of about 127 px. The entry gives a surname and then the office title in full-size type, with no given name. This column sits under the 大參事 heading (heading x1821-1897, name column x1802-1876), not under 知事 at x1951-2025, so the assignment to 大參事 is fixed by measurement. Doi held Koga as daimyo, which is context from outside this leaf rather than anything the page states."
